The modules in this directory are generated from the protocol buffer
definitions of NVIDIA OpenShell (https://github.com/NVIDIA/OpenShell),
release v0.1.7 (tag commit 5d25211b25a8fc887e8d5c606d57d6ab22f1d76c),
files proto/openshell.proto, proto/datamodel.proto, proto/sandbox.proto and
proto/options.proto.

