Regenerate them at a new pinned release (HalC2.OpenShell.Manifest) with
protoc-gen-elixir from the protobuf hex package, from apps/server-ex:

  protoc -I <OpenShell>/proto -I /usr/include \
    --elixir_out=plugins=grpc,package_prefix=hal_c2.open_shell.proto:lib/hal_c2/open_shell/proto \
    <OpenShell>/proto/openshell.proto <OpenShell>/proto/datamodel.proto \
    <OpenShell>/proto/sandbox.proto <OpenShell>/proto/options.proto
